    "methodology": "Compares (language,text,voice) [current canonical key] vs (language,text,voice,configured-speed) [hypothetical old-policy key], using each course's CURRENT voice_config speed as a stand-in — course_audio has no persisted per-row speed, so historical render speed cannot be recovered exactly. This is a lower-bound-ish estimate of the old policy's fragmentation, not an exact historical count."
